DTSTAMP:20261126T003836Z
UID:46b9377f84490f81@nerdhang
CATEGORIES:trains
DESCRIPTION:Presented by the Eastern Division\, Train Collectors Associati
 on (TCA)April 20–24\, 2027 | York Expo Center\, York\, Pennsylvania Get 
 ready for the April 2027 York Train Fair\, the world’s largest model tra
 in event\, proudly hosted by the Eastern Division of the Train Collectors 
 Association (TCA). Held at the expansive York Expo Center\, this multi-day
  celebration brings together train collectors\, operators\, dealers\, and 
 enthusiasts from across the country for an unforgettable week of trains\, 
 trading\, \n\nSource: TCA Eastern Division (York Train Fair)\n\nhttps://ea
 sterntca.com/event/april-2027-meet/
